WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.067 --> 00:00:12.690
The man tapped the hammer gently on something small and blue.

2
00:00:12.691 --> 00:00:15.871
The children heard something breaking.

3
00:00:15.872 --> 00:00:20.074
"Is he Master Antonius?" asked Vinnie.

4
00:00:20.075 --> 00:00:23.463
"Oh no, this man is a mosaic artist,"

5
00:00:23.464 --> 00:00:26.729
said Varius, pointing to the floor.

6
00:00:26.730 --> 00:00:30.081
It was a mosaic of animals and fish.

7
00:00:30.082 --> 00:00:33.341
They examined the mosaic closer.

8
00:00:33.342 --> 00:00:38.801
Little pieces of pottery were stuck together to create a picture.

9
00:00:38.802 --> 00:00:42.735
"That's amazing!" cried Mandy.

10
00:00:42.736 --> 00:00:49.479
A servant finally came and led them to a courtyard in the center of the house.

11
00:00:49.480 --> 00:00:54.601
"This is different from Melus' house," remarked Mandy.

12
00:00:54.602 --> 00:00:56.220
A man appeared.

13
00:00:56.221 --> 00:00:58.468
He wore a large ring.

14
00:00:58.469 --> 00:01:02.554
"Varius!" said the man.

15
00:01:02.555 --> 00:01:05.547
"What's the matter? Be quick, boy.

16
00:01:05.548 --> 00:01:09.015
I must get to the games soon."

17
00:01:09.016 --> 00:01:14.144
"Master Antonius, Aquila is in danger," warned Varius.

18
00:01:14.145 --> 00:01:17.087
"Today's race will not be a fair one."

19
00:01:17.088 --> 00:01:22.954
He told Antonius what Mandy had overheard in the bathhouse.

20
00:01:22.955 --> 00:01:27.807
"Poisoning the horses?" said Master Antonius.

21
00:01:27.808 --> 00:01:31.070
"Horrible! You are sure of this?"

22
00:01:31.071 --> 00:01:35.555
"Brutus wants to win very badly," said Varius.

23
00:01:35.556 --> 00:01:38.139
"He should be watched carefully."

24
00:01:38.140 --> 00:01:44.069
"I'll have extra guards put near the stable," Master Antonius said.

25
00:01:44.070 --> 00:01:49.535
"Thank you!" cried Varius, as he and the children left.

26
00:01:49.536 --> 00:01:54.354
"Now what do we do, Varius?" asked Mandy.

27
00:01:54.355 --> 00:01:57.142
"We'll go to the Circus Maximus.

28
00:01:57.143 --> 00:01:59.469
The race will begin soon.

29
00:01:59.470 --> 00:02:03.537
We have done all that we can," Varius said.

30
00:02:03.538 --> 00:02:06.537
They walked slowly down the road.

31
00:02:06.538 --> 00:02:10.204
A large crowd was walking ahead of them.

32
00:02:10.205 --> 00:02:14.812
"Are they all going to the race?" asked Vinnie.

33
00:02:14.813 --> 00:02:18.342
"Oh yes, people love the chariot races.

34
00:02:18.343 --> 00:02:22.672
Everyone comes to watch and bet on them," said Varius.

35
00:02:22.673 --> 00:02:26.945
They followed the crowd into a large arena.

36
00:02:26.946 --> 00:02:32.350
"Whoa!" Vinnie and Mandy cried together.

37
00:02:32.351 --> 00:02:37.508
The Circus Maximus was a huge arena with many seats.

38
00:02:37.509 --> 00:02:41.298
In the middle of the track was a long stage.

39
00:02:41.299 --> 00:02:45.101
The stage had a huge tower in the middle.

40
00:02:45.102 --> 00:02:48.555
At both ends of the stage were posts.

41
00:02:48.556 --> 00:02:51.676
Metal objects were on a thick bar.

42
00:02:51.677 --> 00:02:56.005
"Vinnie! The photo!" Mandy shouted.

43
00:02:56.006 --> 00:02:58.544
"The old man was here!"

44
00:02:58.545 --> 00:03:00.687
Vinnie took out the photo.

45
00:03:00.688 --> 00:03:03.077
It was glowing blue.

46
00:03:03.078 --> 00:03:08.059
"You're right!" he cried. "But what are they?"

47
00:03:08.060 --> 00:03:11.545
He pointed to the objects on the bar.

48
00:03:11.546 --> 00:03:15.612
"There are seven of them . . . " Mandy counted.

49
00:03:15.613 --> 00:03:17.934
"I think they are dolphins!

50
00:03:17.935 --> 00:03:21.576
But what are they for, Varius?"

51
00:03:21.577 --> 00:03:27.401
"One dolphin is turned up every time the racers go around the track," said Varius.

52
00:03:27.402 --> 00:03:30.148
"Each time around the track is a lap.

53
00:03:30.149 --> 00:03:34.819
The dolphins let the racers know how many laps they have to go."

54
00:03:34.820 --> 00:03:39.177
Just then a tall man walked over to them.

55
00:03:39.178 --> 00:03:42.618
He looked down at Vinnie and Mandy.

56
00:03:42.619 --> 00:03:51.711
"I am Aquila. Are you the children who saved my life?"
